  "notes": "USAGE:\nVery common in casual conversation and on social media. Often used when seeing cute animals, babies, or heartwarming scenes. The phrase {和|なご}んだ or {和|なご}む〜 is a popular reaction online.\n\nFORMS:\n- {和|なご}やか (na-adjective): gentle, harmonious, peaceful\n- {和|なご}ませる: to soothe, to put at ease (transitive)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {心|こころ}が{和|なご}む: the heart is soothed\n- {気持|きも}ちが{和|なご}む: one's feelings are calmed\n- {場|ば}が{和|なご}む: the atmosphere relaxes\n- {表情|ひょうじょう}が{和|なご}む: one's expression softens",
